 TV BROADCAST.'}{'symbol': 'VTRS', 'date': '2023-05-19 14:00:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM INVESTIGATES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF VIATRIS INC. - VTRS', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MAY 19, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- POMERANTZ LLP IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF\xa0VIATRIS INC.\xa0("VIATRIS" OR THE "COMPANY")\xa0(NASDAQ:\xa0VTRS).\xa0 SUCH INVESTORS ARE ADVISED TO CONTACT ROBERT S.'}{'symbol': 'VTRS', 'date': '2023-05-19 12:52:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: ROBBINS LLP INFORMS INVESTORS OF CLASS ACTION AGAINST VIATRIS INC. (VTRS)', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $VTRS #VTRS--VIATRIS INC. (VTRS) MISLED INVESTORS REGARDING ITS BUSINESS PROSPECTS.'}{'symbol': 'VTRS', 'date': '2023-05-19 11:00:00', 'title': 'INVESTOR ALERT: BRONSTEIN, GEWIRTZ & GROSSMAN, LLC NOTIFIES VIATRIS INC. (VTRS) INVESTORS OF CLASS ACTION AND TO ACTIVELY PARTICIPATE', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $VTRS #CLASSACTION--ATTORNEY ADVERTISING--BRONSTEIN, GEWIRTZ & GROSSMAN, LLC NOTIFIES INVESTORS THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED AGAINST VIATRIS INC. (“VIATRIS” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: VTRS) AND CERTAIN OF ITS OFFICERS, ON BEHALF OF ALL PERSONS AND ENTITIES THAT PURCHASED, OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED VIATRIS SECURITIES BETWEEN MARCH 1, 2021 AND FEBRUARY 25, 2022, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"). SUCH INVESTORS ARE ENCOURAGED TO JOIN THIS CASE BY VISITING THE FIRM\'S S.'}{'symbol': 'VTRS', 'date': '2023-05-19 10:30:00', 'title': 'GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP, A LEADING SECURITIES FRAUD LAW FIRM, ANNOUNCES INVESTIGATION OF VIATRIS INC. (VTRS) ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS', 'text': "LOS ANGELES--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP (“GPM”), A LEADING NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LAW FIRM, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMMENCED AN INVESTIGATION ON BEHALF OF VIATRIS INC. (“VIATRIS” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: VTRS) INVESTORS CONCERNING THE COMPANY'S POSSIBLE VIOLATIONS OF THE FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS. IF YOU SUFFERED A LOSS ON YOUR VIATRIS INVESTMENTS OR WOULD LIKE TO INQUIRE ABOUT POTENTIALLY PURSUING CLAIMS TO RECOVER YOUR LOSS UNDER THE FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS, YO."}{'symbol': 'VTRS', 'date': '2023-05-19 09:00:00', 'title': 'INVESTOR ALERT: LAW OFFICES OF HOWARD G. SMITH ANNOUNCES INVESTIGATION OF VIATRIS INC. (VTRS) ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS', 'text': "BENSALEM, PA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--LAW OFFICES OF HOWARD G. SMITH ANNOUNCES AN INVESTIGATION ON BEHALF OF VIATRIS INC. (“VIATRIS” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: VTRS) INVESTORS CONCERNING THE COMPANY'S POSSIBLE VIOLATIONS OF FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS. ON FEBRUARY 28, 2022, BEFORE THE MARKET OPENED, VIATRIS REVEALED THAT IT HAD DECIDED TO UNDERTAKE A GLOBAL RESHAPING OF ITS BUSINESS, ANNOUNCING THAT IT HAD ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO SELL IT BIOSIMILARS BUSINESS TO BIOCON BIOLOGICS LIMITED AND WAS SEEKI."}{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2023-05-19 08:00:00', 'title': 'WELLS FARGO & COMPANY DECLARES CASH DIVIDENDS ON PREFERRED STOCK', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WELLS FARGO & COMPANY (NYSE: WFC) TODAY ANNOUNCED DIVIDENDS ON EIGHT SERIES OF PREFERRED STOCK. A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $18.75 PER SHARE WAS DECLARED ON ITS 7.50% NONCUMULATIVE PERPETUAL CONVERTIBLE CLASS A PREFERRED STOCK, SERIES L, LIQUIDATION PREFERENCE $1,000 PER SHARE, WHICH IS TRADED ON THE NEW YORK STOCK EXCHANGE UNDER THE SYMBOL “WFCPRL”. THE SERIES L DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JUNE 15, 2023, TO HOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MAY 31.'}{'symbol': 'YUM', 'date': '2023-05-19 16:10:00', 'title': 'YUM! BRANDS, INC. DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.605 PER SHARE', 'text': "LOUISVILLE, KY.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--YUM! BRANDS, INC. (NYSE: YUM) BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A DIVIDEND OF $0.605 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK. THE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND WILL BE DISTRIBUTED JUNE 9, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MAY 30, 2023. YUM! BRANDS, INC., BASED IN LOUISVILLE, KENTUCKY, AND ITS SUBSIDIARIES FRANCHISE OR OPERATE A SYSTEM OF OVER 55,000 RESTAURANTS IN MORE THAN 155 COUNTRIES AND TERRITORIES UNDER THE COMPANY'S CONCEPTS – KFC, TACO BELL, PIZZA HUT AND THE."}